==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Christmas D.]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Any close-ranged attackers will be helpful against One Horn, which in turn drops plenty of cash allowing you to deploy your other attackers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] to finish off Blitzen.

==Trivia==
*Coup d'Workshop is derived from [[wikipedia:Coup d'état|coup d'état]], the (usually violent) sudden overthrow of a government by a small group of people; and Santa Claus's workshop.

